  "scope": "Fixed busy-stop-pilot diagnostic only: one selected test per API. Other suite tests were not selected and receive no passing status; this cannot replace a full regression. Two separate controlled scenarios use the real controller and actual stop buttons: an in-flight Fixture platform action stopped from the overlay, and a held local HTTP model reply stopped from MainActivity. Pilot plans two stops per scenario/API; formal plans one hundred, or 1600 stops across eight APIs. Cancellation-observed bounds, platform-call return, target effect and ticket settlement remain distinct. MainActivity FrameMetrics completion does not establish buffer swap, enqueue, or physical presentation. Schema 2 requires the first stopped traversal's VSYNC and four-phase draw-start bracket; historical schema 1 millisecond association does not establish the first stopped traversal FrameMetrics report. overlay removal is not a complete-frame measurement. Failed and missing planned trials remain explicit. These diagnostics do not establish physical-device, all-workload, full-suite or performance-budget acceptance.",
